// binbun.exe's icon (binbun.ico, from scripts/icons.sh), compiled and
// linked by build.rs on Windows. Icon group 1, the executable's only one:
// Explorer and the taskbar show the first group, and GPUI's windows load
// icon 1. The manifest is GPUI's own resource (RT_MANIFEST 1); it does
// not collide with this.
1 ICON "binbun.ico"
